Plain text sample
=================

This file has no syntax to highlight. It checks that ordinary text renders
cleanly in the code viewer: spacing is preserved,    runs of spaces stay,
and unicode like Δ → ü ✓ displays correctly.

  * An indented bullet
  * Another one

A deliberately very long line to check horizontal scrolling: the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog, again and again and again and again and again.
